  "keyFeatures": [
    "X API v2 with full-archive tweet search",
    "OAuth 2.0 and OAuth 1.0a authentication",
    "Filtered and sampled real-time streaming",
    "Tweets, Users, Spaces, Lists, and DMs endpoints",
    "Tiered access: Free, Basic, Pro, Enterprise",
    "Expansions and fields for flexible data retrieval",
    "Rate limiting with per-endpoint quotas",
    "Official SDKs for TypeScript/JavaScript and Python",
    "Webhook-based Account Activity API",
    "Postman collection and developer sandbox"
